06:49.560 --> 06:55.280
It's a normalization layer that happens inside the AI right before it applies its learned weight matrices.

06:55.920 --> 07:04.640
So as the signal travels deeper into the network layer by layer, RMS norm takes the incoming activation vector and basically divides it by its own root mean square.

07:04.780 --> 07:06.980
