07:06.980 --> 07:17.240
Exactly. The AI literally scales down the loud whispers and scales up the quiet ones until they are all the exact same volume before it even attempts to process what the word means.

07:17.580 --> 07:25.320
Wait, if the AI is actively scrubbing away the magnitude at every single layer, then the downstream layers are entirely blind to it.

